    <https://doi.org/10.1038/nature06341> dct:title "Evolution of genes and genomes on the Drosophila phylogeny" .
    <https://doi.org/10.1098/rstb.1952.0012> dct:title "The chemical basis of morphogenesis" .
    <https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1365-294x.2006.03102.x> dct:title "Functional genomics of cactus host shifts in Drosophila mojavensis" .
